  free bosons, EVERY family (D, E, D-1/4, D-3/4, E-3, E-bar, C-6): w^-(q) = 4*sin(q/2)**2, z_P = 2, z_P' = 2, soft set {0} -> class (2, 1)
  SF-1 fermions (record): D, D-1/4, D-3/4 -> (1, 2); E, E-3, E-bar -> (2, 1); C-6 multiscale

=== Sector invariant -> law class: occupation edge k_b against the dispersion ===
  fermions (exclusion)  : k_b^inf(nu) = pi*nu;  edge velocity eps'(k_b) = 2*sin(pi*nu)
  free bosons           : k_b^inf(nu) = 0;  edge velocity eps'(k_b) = 0
  rule: z = 1 iff eps'(k_b^inf) != 0 (occupation edge in band interior); z = 2 iff k_b^inf at a band extremum
    fermion D      nu=1/2 : eps'(k_F) = 2 -> z = 1   (record: 1)
    fermion D-1/4  nu=1/4 : eps'(k_F) = sqrt(2) -> z = 1   (record: 1)
    fermion D-3/4  nu=3/4 : eps'(k_F) = sqrt(2) -> z = 1   (record: 1)
    fermion E/E-3  nu=0   : eps'(k_F) = 0 -> z = 2   (record: 2)
    fermion E-bar  nu=1   : eps'(k_F) = 0 -> z = 2   (record: 2)

